    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omwami Manase owa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase aaba ne bukhulu bwe kimiiko ekhumi ne kibili nga ne aarakikha khukhwamiia. Amiia mu Yerusalemu khu miiko kamakhumi karaano na kiraano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.15.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer. 15.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aakhola kaali kamamayaanu ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Aakhola bibiindu bie khusinya nibio chikholo chichiindi chaba ne chikholile, chikholo nicho Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aaba ne aoona charura mu sibala ebweeni we Baisiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase ombakha lundi abuundi aesuta niiyo raraawe Hesekia atechula. Ombakha alutare khu Baali. Akhola bifwaani bia wele Ashera mala asaaya ching'enieesi ne khuchikholela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.6.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ke Ch. 6.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lundi ombakha chi alutare mu nju ya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi niyo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Ese khasaaywe mu Yerusalemu mindali na mindali,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase ombakha chi alutare che khusaaya ching'enieesi mu mbia chibili che nju ya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aana basoleeli bewe nga siianwa sie khukhwosia; bosebwa mu Litooma lia Beni-Hinomu. Aakhola buolelesi khumenieelesia, ne bulosi. Ne lundi aima bukambisi khukhwama khu bafumu ne babini. Akhola kaali kamamayaanu lukali ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mala aambia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi lirima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.9.3+1KI.9.4+1KI.9.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bab. 9.3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.7.12+2CH.7.13+2CH.7.14+2CH.7.15+2CH.7.16+2CH.7.17+2CH.7.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ke Ch. 7.12-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Manase aakhola sifwaani sie khukhwesaaya mala aasira mu nju eya Wele. Khu nju yino Wele aaba aboolela Daudi ne omusoleeli wewe Solomoni ali, “Mu nju muno ne mu Yerusalemu nilwo ndobore khukhwama mu kholo choosi cha Isiraeli, ese khasaayilwemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se ndikhola lundi Baisiraeli barure mu sibala nisio naelesia bakuuka babwe tawe, baaba ne baria buli sisiindu nisio nabalaka mu mekisio koosi ne kamalaka khubirira khu Musa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Manase akila babaandu ba Yuda ne Yerusalemu bakhola bumayaanu. Bakhola bumayaanu khukhila chikholo nicho Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi abunia ebweeni we Baisiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manase ebiiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alomaloma ne Manase ne babaandu bewe, ne kakhali se barekeeresia tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi areera banamae bakhulu be sipupu sie banamae sio mwami owa Ashuru khubebwaakala. Baamba Manase ne chindobo bamuboa kamakhono ne kiminyololo kie kumukasa mala bamuyila e Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Manase aba mu sibi ekongochela Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi Wele wewe khulwe buyeeti, eboombia lukali ebweeni wa Wele owe bakuuka bewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase aasaba, mala Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aulila liliekoonjelela liewe amukholela siisa. Nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amureera lundi mu Yerusalemu, mu bwami bwewe. Nio Manase amanya ali Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ali Wele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wa kano Manase ombakha lisiisi lienje lie Lukoba lwa Daudi. Aliombakha mwitoma, mumbo mwe khakheechi kha Kihoni. Ombakha lundi e muliango kwe Silibwa sie Eng'eeni mala abotookha sikulu sia Ofeli. Aniinia lisiisi lino lialea lukali. Ara banamae bakhulu mu ngoba choosi chisire mu Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase arusiao wele babaandi ne bifwaani khukhwama mu nju ya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Arusiao lundi chi alutare choosi nicho aaba ne ombakha khu sikulu sie nju ne mu Yerusalemu. Abirusia abimwaata enje we lukoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi akobosiao alutare eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mala aanilakho chimbosio che biianwa bie kumuleembe nende bie khusiima. Manase alaka babaandu ba Yuda basaaye Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakhaba kario, babaandu bachiililila khuana chimbosio abuundu aesuta, ne kakhali chimbosio chabwe chaanwa khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wabwe yeng'ene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sisiakamo sie khukhwamiia khwa Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bibiindu bibiindi nibio Manase akhola, lisaba liewe khu Wele wewe, ne kamakhuwa niko be kamalola bamuboolela mu lisina lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli, bioosi biaandikwa mu sitabu sie chingano che babaami Baisiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisaba lia Manase ne siisa sia Wele khu niye, bumayaanu bwewe bwoosi ne khulekha khuba omweyikinwa, abuundu niio ombakha abuundu aesuta ne khusaaya bifwaani bia wele Ashera, ne bifwaani bibiindi, ebweeni ne akheboombia tawe, bioosi biaandikwa mu sitabu sie chingano che bang'oosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase aafwa mala bamusiikha munju yewe. Nio omwana wewe Amoni amiia mu bweyaangu bwewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omwami Amoni owa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoni aaba ne bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kabili ne kibili nga aarakikha khukhwamiia. Aba omwami khulwe kimiiko kibili mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhola kaali kamamayaanu khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi bulayi bwene nga Manase raraawe ne akhola. Amoni asaaya ne khuana chimbosio khu bifwaani bioosi nibio raraawe Manase aba akhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoni se eboombia ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nga raraawe Manase ne akhola tawe. Ne kakhali Amoni yuno aakhola bumayaanu khutasilila busa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
